      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Exercise induced ST elevation, especially in anterior derivations, does localize the ischemic region. We describe a patient who presented with exercise induced ST elevation in both anterior and inferior leads without prior myocardial infarction. Coronary angiography showed a \"wrap around LAD\" with significant proximal lesion."},
